{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DU6", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-universally-injective}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-stabilizer-preserving}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-aut-iso-unramified}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-etale-universally-injective-open}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44506ab6442bd405e7b9bf1c304c2b60a883595f5bc62e3519d5c6970e187f57", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7873da7ad454d8fbd9928d1d7afe59e7f376ab79ab3a3fad55ea7754d2553963", "source_text": "By Lemma <REF_0001> we see that <MATH_0001> is\nuniversally injective. Combining\nLemmas <REF_0002> and\n<REF_0003>\nwe see that <MATH_0002> is representable by algebraic spaces.\nHence <MATH_0003> is an open immersion by Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0004>.\nTo finish we remark that the condition in the lemma also guarantees\nthat <MATH_0004> is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0c21a361375ca9f349fa5e242521da7262b8deac0579ebdd6bfbabb670c7b562", "unit_id": "tag:0DUD:proof"}
